    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵasalile ŵandu utaŵe wa Nyumba ja AMBUJE",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Daudi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ŵalamwile acimlongola wosope ŵa cilambo ca Isalaeli kuti asongane ku Yelusalemu. Myoyo acimlongola wosope ŵa ngosyo, acikapitawo ŵa makuga gele gagamtumicilaga mwenye, acimlongola ŵa maŵasa, acimlongola ŵa ngondo, acakulungwa ŵakusunga katundu josope ni ng'ombe sya mwenye pamo ni sya ŵanace ŵa mwenye ŵakwe, soni acakulungwa ŵakulolela nyumba ja mwenye, asilikali ŵa ngondo ni ŵandu ŵane ŵakupikanika ŵasongene ku Yelusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵandu wosope piŵasongene ku Yelusalemuko, Mwenye Daudi ŵajimi nipo ŵatite, “Mpikane ŵandu ŵangu. Une nasakaga kutaŵa nyumba jakuŵika Libokosi lya Cilanga ca AMBUJE,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " lyele lyalili mpela cakuliŵatila sajo sya AMBUJE ŵetu. Une songenye yida yosope yakutaŵila nyumbajo pa kwacimbicisya AMBUJE.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.7.1+2SA.7.2+2SA.7.3+2SA.7.4+2SA.7.5+2SA.7.6+2SA.7.7+2SA.7.8+2SA.7.9+2SA.7.10+2SA.7.11+2SA.7.12+2SA.7.13+2SA.7.14+2SA.7.15+2SA.7.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 7:1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.17.1+1CH.17.2+1CH.17.3+1CH.17.4+1CH.17.5+1CH.17.6+1CH.17.7+1CH.17.8+1CH.17.9+1CH.17.10+1CH.17.11+1CH.17.12+1CH.17.13+1CH.17.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Mbi 17:1-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Mlungu ŵandekasisye une kuti ngataŵila nyumba ligongo une ndili jwa ngondo nambo soni nawuleje ŵandu ŵajinji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo AMBUJE, Mlungu juŵamlambilaga Aisalaeli ŵasagwile une pasikati pa liŵasa lya acinangolo ŵangu pamo ni ŵanace ŵangu kuti lamulile cilambo ca Isalaeli mpaka kalakala. Soni AMBUJE Mlungu ŵasagwile ŵandu ŵa lukosyo lwa Yuda kuti aŵe acimlongola ŵa ngosyo, nipo kutyocela ku lukosyo lwa Yuda, ŵasagwile liŵasa lya baba ŵangu. Kutyocela ku liŵasa lyeleli yamnonyele Mlungu kusagula une kuti m'mbe mwenye jwa cilambo cosope ca Aisalaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pakuŵa AMBUJE ŵambele une ŵanace ŵajinji nipo mwa ŵanace ŵeleŵa, AMBUJE ŵamsagwile Solomoni kuti alamulile cilambo ca Isalaeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Soni AMBUJE ŵasalile une kuti, ‘Mwanagwenu Solomoni ni jwele jutacindaŵila une nyumba. Namsagwile jwelejo kuti aŵe mwanangu, nipo une tinjiŵa babagwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tinjiwutamilisya ucimwene ŵakwe kuti uŵe wa mpaka ku ndaŵi syangamala naga akupitilisya kupikanila cenene malamusi gangu mpela mwakutendela sambano jino.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Sambano ngumŵenda ŵandu ŵangu pameso pa Mlungu jwetu, nambo soni pameso pa ŵandu wosope ŵa AMBUJE ŵimsongenemwe kuti msunjeje ni kugapikanila malamusi gosope ga AMBUJE Mlungu jwenu, kuti mpitilisye kutama mcilambo camboneci, ni kuti cilamboci ticiŵe ca ŵanace ŵenu mpaka kalakala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamsalile soni Solomoni kuti, “Mwanangu, ngumsalicisya kuti mumpikanileje Mlungu jwa baba ŵenu ni mtima wenu wosope ni m'mwe ŵakulipeleka. Mlungu akusamanyilila nganisyo sya mundu jwalijose. Naga mkusosasosa timcisimana, nipo naga mkulekangana najo, nombe najo tacimleka mpaka kalakala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkwenela kumanyilila kuti AMBUJE amsagwile m'mwejo kuti mwataŵile nyumba jawo. Sambano mlimbe mtima nipo mkamule masengoga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Daudi ŵapelece kwa Solomoni mapulani ga utaŵe wa yipinda ya Nyumba ja AMBUJEJO, gakulosya lipenu, yipinda yakusunjila yipanje ya Mwenye Daudi, ni yipinda ya mwinani, ni Cipinda Ceswela Mnope kwele ŵakululucilaga ulemwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapelece soni mapulani ga yindu yesope yiŵaganisyaga gakulosya luŵala lwa nyumba, yipinda yosope yakusunjila yipanje yawo ni soni yipinda yakusunjila mituka jakupelecedwa kwa AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapelece soni kwa Solomoni mapulani gakusala ugaŵe wa makuga ga ŵambopesi ni Alefi ni soni ugaŵe wa masengo gosope ga m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE, ni kusamalila kwa yida yosope yakamulila masengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamsalile Solomoni usito wa golidi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jwakusacikwa kuti apanganyicisye yida ya m'Nyumba ja AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵamsalile soni usito wa golidi ni silifa jwakupanganyicisya yakuŵika nyali pamo ni nyali syakwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "soni usito wa golidi jwakupanganyicisya tebulo ja golidi jakuŵika mkate wakupeleka kwa AMBUJE, ni usito wa silifa jwakupanganyicisya matebulo ga silifa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwalakweju ŵamsalicisye winji wa golidi jwakupanganyicisya mafoloko, mabeseni ni makapu. Ŵasalicisye soni usito wa golidi jwakupanganyicisya mbale jilijose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵamsalile Solomoni usito wa golidi jwakupanganyicisya malo gakutinicisya ubani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Ŵamsalile soni usito wa golidi jwakupanganyicisya ligeleta lyakunyakulila akelubi ali atambasukwile mapapiko gawo penani pa Libokosi lya Cilanga ca AMBUJE. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenye Daudi ŵatite, “Yosope yinembileyi yikukamulana ni maloŵe gele giŵasalile une AMBUJE, nipo nagapikanicisye cenene kuti masengo gosopego gakwenela kutendekwa pakukuya gele mapulanigo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ŵamsalile soni Solomoni kuti, “Mŵe ŵamacili nipo myitende yeleyi mwakulimba mtima. Mkajogopa soni mkajasa mtima, pakuŵa AMBUJE Mlungu jwangu ngasaleka kumsamalila m'mwejo, nambo taciŵa ni m'mwejo pa masengo gosope ga Nyumba ja AMBUJEJI. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
